<title>UK: First National Bank Chicago sets $250 mln bond.</title>
<headline>First National Bank Chicago sets $250 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST NATIONAL BANK OF CHICAGO</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    08.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   L06.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD  **+23-24 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED. L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.175     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
